{# On the council's agenda.

   SEPARATE FROM COUNCIL CORNER, DELIBERATELY. Council corner is the
   Community Council's own record, drawn only from their approved minutes,
   and nothing writes into it from anywhere else. This page is drawn only
   from North Ayrshire's committee papers and meeting calendar. Different
   source, different tense, no cross-reference between them. If a reader
   notices the same subject in both, that is their inference to draw, not
   this site's claim to make.

   WHAT THIS PAGE KNOWS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT. It knows a meeting is
   happening, whether papers have been lodged, and whether the word Largs
   appears in them. It has not read a single document. So every row says
   "mentions" and links out — it never characterises, summarises or ranks.
   A page that guessed at substance would be worth less than nothing here.

   Links go to the MEETING PAGE, not the file. The meeting page lists the
   agenda items and survives; document links are 600-character encrypted
   tokens that may not.

   No JavaScript. The folds are <details>, which is markup, not script. #}

<div class="wrap">
{% if not agenda.ok %}
  <p class="agenda-empty">The agenda list has not been collected yet, so there is
  nothing to show. This page will fill in once it has run.</p>
{% else %}

{# When the council's website was last read, said on every visit -- the
   same stamp the roadworks page carries ("Register data to …"). The page
   can only vouch for what it saw that day. Past agenda.staleDays it says
   so in the sand box already used for "nothing here": a lapsed check is
   a fact to state, not an alarm to raise. #}
<div class="kicker">
  <span class="stamp">Council's website last checked {% if agenda.collectedAt %}{{ agenda.collectedAt | dom }} {{ agenda.collectedAt | monthShort }}{% else %}— date unknown{% endif %}</span>
</div>
{% if agenda.stale %}
<p class="agenda-none"><strong>This page has not checked the council's website
since {% if agenda.collectedAt %}{{ agenda.collectedAt | dateLong }}{% else %}its last collection{% endif %}.</strong>
Papers published since then have not been looked at, so what follows is how
things stood on that day, not today.</p>
{% endif %}

<p class="agenda-intro">North Ayrshire Council publishes the papers for its
committees at least three days before each meeting. This page lists the ones
that mention Largs, so you can see what is coming before it is decided rather
than after. Some mentions are decisions about the town; others are just the name
in a list. Follow the link to see which.</p>

<h2>Coming up</h2>
{% if agenda.upcoming | length %}
  <ul class="agenda-list">
  {% for m in agenda.upcoming %}
    <li class="agenda-row agenda-ahead">
      <p class="agenda-when">{{ m.display }}</p>
      <p class="agenda-what">
        {% if m.url %}<a href="{{ m.url }}">{{ m.committee }}</a>
        {% else %}{{ m.committee }}{% endif %}
      </p>
      <p class="agenda-detail">{{ m.hits }} mention{% if m.hits != 1 %}s{% endif %}
      of Largs in the papers{% if m.read %}, counted by this site from the pack{% endif %}.</p>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% elif agenda.stale %}
  <p class="agenda-none">None was known when the council's website was last
  checked.</p>
{% else %}
  <p class="agenda-none">{% if agenda.counts.papersRead %}This site has read the
  papers published for {{ agenda.counts.papersRead }} of the meetings ahead, and
  none mentions Largs.{% if agenda.counts.papersOut %} {{ agenda.counts.papersOut }}
  more {% if agenda.counts.papersOut == 1 %}has{% else %}have{% endif %} papers out
  not read yet.{% endif %}{% else %}The council's search finds no mention of Largs
  in the papers published so far. Its index can run a fortnight behind
  publication, so a mention can still turn up.{% endif %} Papers appear about
  three days before a meeting.</p>
{% endif %}

{% if agenda.counts.scheduled %}
<p class="agenda-forward"><a href="/on-the-agenda/scheduled/">{{ agenda.counts.scheduled }}
more meetings are in the council's diary{% if agenda.scheduledTo %}, up to
{{ agenda.scheduledTo }}{% endif %} →</a><br>
<span class="agenda-sub">{% set pr = agenda.counts.papersRead %}{% set po = agenda.counts.papersOut %}
{%- if pr or po %}{% if pr %}{{ pr }} of them {% if pr == 1 %}has{% else %}have{% endif %}
papers out which this site has read: no mention of Largs.{% endif %}{% if po %} {{ po }}
{% if pr %}more{% else %}of them{% endif %} {% if po == 1 %}has{% else %}have{% endif %} papers
out not read yet, and no mention found by the council's search so far.{% endif %}
The rest are not published yet.{% else %}Their papers are not published yet, so
there is no way to know yet whether Largs is in them.{% endif %}</span></p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Recently</h2>
{% if agenda.recent | length %}
  <ul class="agenda-list">
  {% for m in agenda.recent %}
    <li class="agenda-row">
      <p class="agenda-when">{{ m.display }}</p>
      <p class="agenda-what">
        {% if m.url %}<a href="{{ m.url }}">{{ m.committee }}</a>
        {% else %}{{ m.committee }}{% endif %}
      </p>
      <p class="agenda-detail">{{ m.hits }} mention{% if m.hits != 1 %}s{% endif %}
